TuxGuitar's test files
======================

The files in this folder are TuxGuitar's, copied unchanged from its
repository, github.com/helge17/tuxguitar, at commit
9f2647dfc216401cc70569f1ab25ad03e18cab5b (3 Nov 2026):

- common/TuxGuitar-lib/src/test/resources/: Untitled_20.tg,
  Untitled_extended_21.tg, Untitled_extended_30.tg, altRepeatLoop_20.tg,
  fix_20.tg, freeEditionMode_20.tg, getNextTied_20.tg, invalidContent.tg,
  invalidContent2.tg, invalidVersion.tg, letRing_20.tg, noVersion.tg,
  notTuxGuitar.tg, reference_20.tg, tempo_20.tg, test_20.xml,
  track_pitch_20.tg, and the format's schema, tuxguitar_20.xsd
- common/TuxGuitar-compat/src/test/resources/: Untitled_15.tg,
  reference_15.tg
- common/TuxGuitar-editor-utils/src/test/resources/: tiedNotes_20.tg
- common/TuxGuitar-midi/src/test/resources/: test_midi_20.tg

