text is at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.html.

OxiGuitar's tests read them to check that its TuxGuitar plugin reads what
TuxGuitar's own tests say they hold (tests/tuxguitar_files.rs), that
what it writes validates against TuxGuitar's schema (tests/read_write.rs),
and to seed the fuzzer.
